WEBVTT

00:00:05.173 --> 00:00:10.969
Choose Upload in the side menu.

00:00:11.219 --> 00:00:16.819
Tick Science to give
every file this category.

00:00:17.069 --> 00:00:22.669
Select Everyone from the Suitability list.

00:00:22.919 --> 00:00:28.855
Select 2 at a time from
the Files at once list.

00:00:29.105 --> 00:00:35.105
Click Choose videos.

00:00:37.710 --> 00:00:43.171
Choose a file from your computer.

00:00:43.421 --> 00:00:48.819
Wait until you see Uploaded just now.

00:00:49.069 --> 00:00:55.069
Check that Details were
saved with the draft.
